/* 视觉规范 v1：状态白卡（阶段标签 20 高 → 12 → 标题 20/700 → 4 → 说明 12）；金额卡同样内边距 16，卡间 12 */
.waiver-page { padding: var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-layout-page-padding-x) var(--xy-space-6); color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.waiver-card { padding: var(--xy-space-4); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-lg); background: var(--xy-color-surface); }
.waiver-card + .waiver-card { margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); }
.phase-label { display: inline-flex; height: 20px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: var(--xy-space-3); padding: 0 var(--xy-space-1); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-sm); background: var(--xy-color-control-surface); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-caption-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-bold); line-height: var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.phase-success { background: var(--xy-color-brand-light); color: var(--xy-color-brand); }
.phase-failure { background: var(--xy-color-warning-soft); color: var(--xy-color-warning); }
.waiver-title { display: block; color: var(--xy-color-text-strong); font-size: var(--xy-text-page-title-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-bold); line-height: var(--xy-text-page-title-line-height); }
.waiver-copy { display: block; margin-top: var(--xy-space-1); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.order-line { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--xy-space-3); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.order-line > text:first-child { flex: 0 0 72px; color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); }
.order-line > text:last-child { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-align: right; }
.order-identifier { align-items: flex-start; margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); padding-top: var(--xy-space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--xy-color-divider); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); }
.order-identifier > text:last-child { flex: 1; color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; word-break: break-all; }
